    "Condition : 1 - The proposed development, because of its position, size, scale and appearance, would constitute a bulky and obtrusive feature that would harm the appearance and character of the original house, the surrounding gardens and the area as a whole. It would result in a poor and overbearing outlook for neighbours, harmful to their living conditions. The proposal therefore fails to meet Adopted UDP Policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations), and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines (July 2002)."
